<title>FRANCE: UAP denies in any takeover talks.</title>
<headline>UAP denies in any takeover talks.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>UAP chairman Jacques Friedmann said that the French insurance group was not engaged in any talks regarding the possible takeover of the company.</p>
<p>&quot;I deny any negotiations (are under way) with anyone,&quot; he told reporters.</p>
<p>UAP's shares were recently driven higher by market speculation that rival insurer Axa could make it a takeover target.</p>
<p>Friedmann said that he had no indication that anything of the sort was being considered.</p>
<p>Union des Assurances earlier reported a 6.7 percent rise in first-half profit and said it was on track for a return to &quot;lasting profitability&quot;.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
